-- James Mendoza (CMC) -> Markstein check-ins, 6/2-10/23/2026 (2026-10-29, per Chad).
-- From Chad's tracking spreadsheet (6/1-8/9) + James's 11 Monday "Weekly Recap"
-- emails (8/9-10/25). Docs: claude/markstein-james-import-plan.md,
-- claude/PROJECT-STATUS_10.md.
--
-- Every store James visited was matched to its account ahead of time (Claude,
-- against the live account list): by VIP outlet id, then by address (spelling
-- like "First St" / "1st St" handled), then checked by hand. 933 visits at
-- 421 stores -> 406 existing accounts + 12 new ones.
--
-- What it does:
--   1. Adds 12 stores that aren't in the account list as Markstein accounts
--      ("CMC-" id) -> they show as Prospects.
--   2. Sets every account James visited to distributor Markstein (Chad: "if
--      James visited it, its a Markstein account now").
--   3. Saves every visit as a check-in: rep "James", source "CMC: James
--      spreadsheet" / "CMC: James weekly recap".
-- Safe to run more than once: step 3 first removes James's earlier imported
-- check-ins up to 10/25 (nothing else).

begin;

on conflict (outlet_id) do nothing;

update public.sales_accounts set distributor = 'Markstein', updated_at = now()
