('2921123','2026-08-03'::date,'James','On Premise Visit','Committed','Ashley committed to offering the Big Daddy 19.2 format to begin with and will evaluate sales before potentially expanding the account into draft. This placement creates an opportunity to introduce the brand to a strong on-premise audience while establishing a path toward additional volume if sales support the expansion.',null,'Ashley','CMC: James spreadsheet'),
('3195564','2026-08-03'::date,'James','Off Premise Visit','Committed','Gulu, the new manager, agreed to reinvest in the Big Daddy Six-Packs after selling down to just one unit remaining. This reinvestment demonstrates positive movement at the account and provides an opportunity to maintain consistent inventory as the new manager takes over operations.',null,'Gulu','CMC: James spreadsheet'),
