('3778878','2026-08-04'::date,'James','Off Premise Visit','Committed','Sunny was highly receptive to the portfolio and wanted to carry all four pre-packaged SKUs. He approved an investment across the full packaged portfolio and also allowed POS to be placed at the front of the store. The combination of full portfolio placement and prominent point-of-sale visibility creates a strong opportunity to build brand awareness and drive trial at this account.',null,'Sunny','CMC: James spreadsheet'),
