('96298','2026-08-04'::date,'James','Off Premise Visit','Committed','David, the store manager, committed to investing in both the Big Daddy Six-Packs and Captain Hazy in the coming weeks as he adjusts to taking on order-writing responsibilities while the store works to hire a new team member.',null,'David','CMC: James spreadsheet'),
('2213498','2026-08-04'::date,'James','On Premise Visit','Follow-Up','Customer has not had a chance to sample everything yet but states he will contact me or his assigned distributor representative when he wishes to move forward with the brand.',null,'Harley','CMC: James spreadsheet'),
('4697313','2026-08-04'::date,'James','On Premise Visit','Follow-Up','Customer is giving the samples to her beer drinkers; if it is well received, we should make the order for delivery next week. This is a once-a-month account that submits its own order.',null,'Lc','CMC: James spreadsheet'),
('4192596','2026-08-04'::date,'James','On Premise Visit','Follow-Up','The new buyer was not in. Will revisit another time to introduce myself and the brand.',null,'Ryan Medina','CMC: James spreadsheet'),
