('3660546','2026-08-05'::date,'James','On Premise Visit','Follow-Up','Customer is going to sample the product and review sales materials before deciding whether the product makes sense for her account in either format.',null,'Elise','CMC: James spreadsheet'),
('4800114','2026-08-05'::date,'James','On Premise Visit','Committed','Jeff approved an initial investment in both Big Daddy Singles and Captain Hazy, with the products being offered at the downstairs bar as well as the mini mart in the lobby. This account provides valuable exposure across both on-premise and retail-style channels and represents another strong opportunity to introduce the portfolio to hotel guests and bar customers.',null,'Jeffery','CMC: James spreadsheet'),
('535784','2026-08-05'::date,'James','Off Premise Visit','Committed','Paras approved an initial investment in the Big Daddy Singles and will evaluate sales performance and customer feedback before expanding into additional products. This measured initial placement provides an opportunity to establish the brand at the account and build toward a broader portfolio placement based on consumer response.',null,'Paras','CMC: James spreadsheet'),
('2931628','2026-08-05'::date,'James','Off Premise Visit','Follow-Up','Customer looks forward to sampling the SKUs; 70% sure the account will add at least one of the beers. She has invested in every brand I represent up to this point.',null,'Dana','CMC: James spreadsheet'),
