('2921568','2026-08-05'::date,'James','Off Premise Visit','Follow-Up','Customer wasn''t a fan of the Captain Hazy but thinks he will move forward with the Big Daddy 19.2s in the next couple of weeks once space opens up. Will wait to claim this until the product lands.',null,'Joseph','CMC: James spreadsheet'),
('537312','2026-08-05'::date,'James','On Premise Visit','Follow-Up','Customer states he is finishing up his busy season right now and expects to have time to fully evaluate the brand toward the second half of the month.',null,'Toby','CMC: James spreadsheet'),
