('2923738','2026-08-05'::date,'James','Off Premise Visit','Committed','DJ committed to an initial investment in the Big Daddy Singles and Pie of the Tiger 4-Packs. He will evaluate customer response and sales before determining the next steps for portfolio expansion. This placement adds another point of distribution in Oakland and provides an opportunity to establish the brand with a new customer base.',null,'Dj','CMC: James spreadsheet'),
('2745069','2026-08-06'::date,'James','Off Premise Visit','Committed','Ninette received her Big Daddy Singles, and the shelf is now fully stocked. This sale was completed retroactively and ensures the account is properly positioned with inventory to support continued sales and consumer visibility. Delivery not yet confirmed in VIP (VIP down since 7/29/26).',null,'Ninette','CMC: James spreadsheet'),
('541052','2026-08-06'::date,'James','Off Premise Visit','Pass/Not Now','Customer states the price point is too high and business is too slow to add any new items right now.',null,'Eyassu Deba','CMC: James spreadsheet'),
('531548','2026-08-06'::date,'James','Off Premise Visit','Follow-Up','Big Daddy is down to two six-packs on the shelf, and there is only one can of Pie of the Tiger left. Normal point of contact is on vacation for the next couple of weeks, and the clerk couldn''t tell me what was being ordered.',null,'Javier','CMC: James spreadsheet'),
('3034615','2026-08-06'::date,'James','Off Premise Visit','Committed','Daniel approved a reinvestment in the Big Daddy Six-Packs, increasing his order from one case to two cases. He also expanded the account to include the Big Daddy 19.2 format while reinvesting in Captain Hazy. The increased order volume and additional format demonstrate strong confidence in the portfolio and create an opportunity to continue growing sales at this key Berkeley account.',null,'Daniel','CMC: James spreadsheet'),
('2016250','2026-08-06'::date,'James','On Premise Visit','Follow-Up','Customer is going to sample the product and review sales materials. Customer prefers draft; our opportunity right now would be to replace Sierra Nevada after he sells through his current keg and backstock.',null,'John','CMC: James spreadsheet'),
('4608687','2026-08-06'::date,'James','On Premise Visit','Follow-Up','Customer wants to offer more local items within a 50-mile radius and states he is pretty set on IPAs right now, but he is familiar with Big Daddy and it could be an option later down the road.',null,'Brandt','CMC: James spreadsheet'),
('2210862','2026-08-06'::date,'James','On Premise Visit','Follow-Up','Customer was happy to hear Big Daddy is available and will work with the assigned distributor representative to get the product in on her rotating handle within the next few weeks. The buyer even declined samples because she already knows the beer is great. Will monitor moving forward.',null,'Julie','CMC: James spreadsheet'),
('3998631','2026-08-06'::date,'James','Off Premise Visit','Follow-Up','Captain Hazy is available as singles and 4-packs. Didn''t see any Big Daddy tags. Store manager recently transferred from the Santa Rosa location and states all items must be approved by corporate.',null,'Grace','CMC: James spreadsheet'),
('540820','2026-08-07'::date,'James','Off Premise Visit','Follow-Up','Customer will review sales materials and sample product with ownership and take it from there. At first glance, the account is most interested in the Big Daddy Singles.',null,'Arvind','CMC: James spreadsheet'),
('4908904','2026-08-07'::date,'James','On Premise Visit','Follow-Up','The owner is on vacation, but I left sales materials and samples for his review. This is a smaller account with 4 taps and he doesn''t do a lot of pre-pack options due to limited cooler space. I think he will love the Big Daddy.',null,'Chris','CMC: James spreadsheet'),
('533635','2026-08-07'::date,'James','On Premise Visit','Follow-Up','Introduced the brand portfolio available through Markstein to the buyer. Customer seemed most interested in the Big Daddy. Going to review sales materials and sample product with ownership and take it from there.',null,'John','CMC: James spreadsheet'),
