('2015472','2026-07-27'::date,'James','Off Premise Visit','Committed','Chetna invested in the Big Daddy Six-Packs along with Captain Hazy and Pie of the Tiger 4-Packs. As a well-respected craft beer retailer with ownership of multiple accounts throughout the Bay Area, this placement serves as an important trial that could lead to additional distribution opportunities across their network.',null,'Chetna','CMC: James spreadsheet'),
