('3609009','2026-07-28'::date,'James','On Premise Visit','Follow-Up','Customer remembers the brand and is ready, timing-wise, to rotate us back in. Excited to sample the Captain Hazy and Pie of the Tiger varieties — could be a multi-placement account if all goes well. Customer will review sales materials and sample product before deciding. This is a once-a-month account that submits its own order.',null,'Jake','CMC: James spreadsheet'),
('540836','2026-07-28'::date,'James','On Premise Visit','Follow-Up','Customer remembers the brand but is excited to sample the other SKUs available through our distributor partner. Going to try the product with the account owner and review sales materials before deciding next steps.',null,'Vj','CMC: James spreadsheet'),
('2907397','2026-07-28'::date,'James','Off Premise Visit','Delivered','Kevin approved an initial placement of the Captain Hazy 4-Packs and plans to evaluate customer feedback before expanding into additional SKUs. This account represents another quality opportunity to grow the portfolio.','Captain Hazy (16oz) x1','Kevin','CMC: James spreadsheet'),
