('2907395','2026-07-28'::date,'James','Off Premise Visit','Follow-Up','Owner wasn''t in. Cashier states I can call back or visit after 5pm when the owner is expected to be at the account.',null,'Kevin','CMC: James spreadsheet'),
('4083163','2026-07-28'::date,'James','On Premise Visit','Follow-Up','Account is going through a transfer of ownership and is currently in the midst of a remodel. Introduced the brand, left samples, emailed sell sheets and onboarding forms with our distributor partner, and cc''d the craft specialist for the territory. Customer expects to be up and running in the next week or so.',null,'Raj','CMC: James spreadsheet'),
('4376002','2026-07-28'::date,'James','On Premise Visit','Follow-Up','Account was closed until Thursday, but I ran into the owner and the mural artist outside the entrance. Customer remembers the brand and is interested in the product. Wants to sample the liquid and review sales materials with his lead bartender Lyla before making a decision.',null,'Aaron','CMC: James spreadsheet'),
('3399674','2026-07-28'::date,'James','On Premise Visit','Delivered','Customer remembers the brand and is excited to sample the liquid. States he can definitely see adding one of the IPAs to the rotation. Mentioned we''re working on football point of sale to kick off the season, which would be a great addition. Customer submits their own order.','Captain Hazy (1/6 bbl) x1','Alfred','CMC: James spreadsheet'),
('4800114','2026-07-28'::date,'James','On Premise Visit','Follow-Up','Normal point of contact had already left for the day. Was waiting to speak with the general manager after his conference call, but the call ran past the expected end time.',null,'Richard','CMC: James spreadsheet'),
