('539336','2026-07-29'::date,'James','On Premise Visit','Follow-Up','Account currently has backstock of Captain Hazy offered at the snack bar. Note: the account is undergoing renovations on the golf course and in the parking lots, not expected to finish until spring. Customer states they aren''t ordering much right now except for weddings/events held here. Will sample product and review sales materials.',null,'Michael','CMC: James spreadsheet'),
('2014697','2026-07-29'::date,'James','On Premise Visit','Follow-Up','Customer remembers Big Daddy and Captain Hazy. States Hazy IPAs are slower here and West Coast IPAs do best. Will sample the product and review sales materials before deciding.',null,'Alma','CMC: James spreadsheet'),
('2143495','2026-07-29'::date,'James','On Premise Visit','Follow-Up','Customer remembers Big Daddy but states corporate won''t approve Captain Hazy due to its name. Will sample the product and review sales materials before deciding if the liquid makes sense for the account.',null,'Faris','CMC: James spreadsheet'),
('4905718','2026-07-29'::date,'James','Off Premise Visit','Follow-Up','Customer states he''ll choose one or two of the SKUs with his assigned distributor representative when he visits tomorrow to write the order.',null,'Jag','CMC: James spreadsheet'),
('3293751','2026-07-29'::date,'James','On Premise Visit','Interested','Customer enjoyed the samples left on my previous visit and states a tap will be opening up soon. Most likely going to start with Big Daddy and take it from there.',null,'Irving','CMC: James spreadsheet'),
('533262','2026-07-29'::date,'James','Off Premise Visit','Follow-Up','Customer still wants Big Daddy and Captain Hazy, but the product was out of stock the last couple of times she tried to order. Next order is next week — will try again then.',null,'Pam','CMC: James spreadsheet'),
