('2907373','2026-07-31'::date,'James','Off Premise Visit','Committed','Lovie is happy to invest in both Captain Hazy and Pie of the Tiger 4-Packs. Investment from this key craft account reflects growing confidence in the portfolio and provides a strong platform for future growth.',null,'Lovie','CMC: James spreadsheet'),
('3129050','2026-07-31'::date,'James','On Premise Visit','Follow-Up','Owner had just left and keeps sporadic hours because he lives in Sacramento. Introduced the brand, left samples and my contact info, and reached out to the on-premise manager at our distributor partner to let them know I stopped by.',null,'Liz','CMC: James spreadsheet'),
