('3302955','2026-10-09'::date,'James','On Premise Visit','Visited','Customer states that even though he enjoyed the samples he is not ready to invest at this time. The account currently has an abundance of inventory from octoberfest and fresh hop beer season and the sell through/business for them has slowed. That combined with the fact that they have very limited space means that at this time it is a no, however they will keep us in mind for the future.',null,'Jake','CMC: James weekly recap'),
