('3631649','2026-09-28'::date,'James','On Premise Visit','Visited','I have visited this account before for my other brands. Revisited with the account manager and introduced the brand. An obstacle right now is that the owner has the final say and he spends a majority of his time at his Auburn location, and he hasnt been responsive to emails. For now it is a no but i did obtain the owners phone number so i will reach out via text to see if he is more responsive. The manager also states that business has been very slow and that they are barely breaking even now after paying bills',null,'Goldy','CMC: James weekly recap'),
