('4297029','2026-09-28'::date,'James','Off Premise Visit','Visited','Customer is out of town and has not communicated next steps yet to her bar manager. Customer states that they always run 3 sour taps and that they do offer a variety of pre pack options so he believes that any of our products could make sense for their account. He states that he will sample them and advocate for what he thinks will do the best at the account',null,'Suzanne Nardone','CMC: James weekly recap'),
('3941811','2026-09-28'::date,'James','On Premise Visit','Committed','Customer states that he is the order writer for the account and that he will bring in the big daddy either this week or next since they were able to repair one of the kegerators since my last visit. Customer went on to state that he will most likely invest in at least captain hazy or pie of the tiger, if not both once the other kegerator is repaired. For now i will claim the big daddy sixtel and revisit with the account over the next couple weeks.','Committed: Big Daddy IPA 1/6 Barrel Keg','Mitch','CMC: James weekly recap'),
('3979526','2026-09-29'::date,'James','Off Premise Visit','Visited','Account is focused on items in the current schematic',null,'Scott','CMC: James weekly recap'),
('4476658','2026-09-29'::date,'James','Off Premise Visit','Visited','The customer will review sales materials and consult with their assigned distributor representative to see if any of the products make sense for their account',null,'Quan lee','CMC: James weekly recap'),
('3129017','2026-09-29'::date,'James','On Premise Visit','Visited','Customer states that she is not interested in any new items and that she is good with what she has to offer currently.',null,'Rupinder','CMC: James weekly recap'),
('3975175','2026-09-29'::date,'James','On Premise Visit','Visited','Introduced the brand. The account does do a decent amount of to go options so this could be a win here if the owner likes the product. Account gave me the buyers cell number so i will reach out with sales materials so they know what they are looking at when they return later this week. The account has 4 taps that are available right now so this could be great timing.',null,'Jonah','CMC: James weekly recap'),
('3790259','2026-09-29'::date,'James','Off Premise Visit','Visited','Customer wants to review sales materials and consult with his assigned distributor representative to see what they believe is a good fit for the account',null,'Mohammed','CMC: James weekly recap'),
('3199120','2026-09-29'::date,'James','On Premise Visit','Visited','Customer did not receive the half barrel of big daddy last week. The account still wants the product, i reached out to the assigned representative and he said he added it to the order for delivery this Friday, so we should be good to go',null,null,'CMC: James weekly recap'),
('2355677','2026-09-29'::date,'James','On Premise Visit','Visited','Customer still believes that even though the liquid was enjoyable and that he likes the big daddy ipa that they are pretty set on their current offerings and align with the sentiment that if it isnt broke, dont fix it. The buyer stating that it is hard to get new product into this account but he will bring it up to account ownership later this week. Looks like the account is going to stick with the ballast point sculpin after all',null,'Marianna','CMC: James weekly recap'),
('4127823','2026-09-29'::date,'James','On Premise Visit','Visited','On my last visit i texted my normal point of contact, however i didnt hear back. Today the owner will not be in until after 5 pm so i am going to try and remember to call the account around that time to see if we can schedule a meeting since i have not received a response via email or text',null,'Jasive','CMC: James weekly recap'),
('3432870','2026-09-29'::date,'James','On Premise Visit','Visited','The order writer is not in today, i will call back tomorrow to see what his feedback is on the product and if he would like to proceed with investment',null,'Gilberto','CMC: James weekly recap'),
('4589692','2026-09-29'::date,'James','On Premise Visit','Visited','The buyer is back from vacation but is not working today. Customer states that he passed along the samples and my contact information but has not heard any feedback on the brand. I will have to revisit at a later date to meet with the buyer officially.',null,'Ernesto','CMC: James weekly recap'),
('3605388','2026-09-29'::date,'James','On Premise Visit','Visited','Customer has not had a chance to sample the product i left on my previous visit but will reach out with feedback once she has had a chance to evaluate everything and identify what makes the most sense for the account',null,'Steven','CMC: James weekly recap'),
