('2918238','2026-09-30'::date,'James','On Premise Visit','Visited','Customer has still not had a chance to sample the other SKUs, i can see them in the pre pack fridge. Customer still wants the big daddy ipa but it appears that we are out of stock at the warehouse',null,'Sonia','CMC: James weekly recap'),
