('4062564','2026-09-30'::date,'James','On Premise Visit','Visited','On my last visit, Customer is going to sample the product and review sales materials to see if he believes any of the products make sense for the account. Customer stated he hasnt had big daddy since the brewery shut down and he is familiar with both captain hazy and pie of the tiger. Today jesse was not there during my visit so i will revisit again in the next couple of weeks. Account is on a once a month frequency and submits their own order',null,'Jesse','CMC: James weekly recap'),
('531548','2026-10-01'::date,'James','Off Premise Visit','Committed','Customer is sold out of the big daddy ipa and will reinvest in the product as well as both captain hazy and pie of the tiger on his delivery next week and as soon as we are restocked at the warehouse','Committed: Big Daddy IPA 4/6 pack 12oz Cans; Full Circle Apricot Pie of the Tiger 6/4 pack 16oz; Full Circle Captain Save a Hop Hazy IPA 6/4 pack 16oz','Steve','CMC: James weekly recap'),
('3953028','2026-10-01'::date,'James','Field Visit','Visited','On my last visit, Customer was most interested in the big daddy ipa. Our one opportunity is to replace the Ashai beer once they leave markstein in a couple of weeks. The account has one keg on and one in backstock so the buyer believes he will be ready to transition by the end of the month. Today the customer stated that he has not had time to go through everything but will be free in a couple of weeks so i will reach out then',null,'Kyungsoo','CMC: James weekly recap'),
('3034615','2026-10-01'::date,'James','Off Premise Visit','Committed','Customer states that the speakeasy products did not sell well which is interesting because both the six packs and the singles are sold out. Customer also sold out of the pie of the tiger and the captain hazy but states that those are the products he will reinvest in','Committed: Full Circle Captain Save a Hop Hazy IPA 6/4 pack 16oz; Full Circle Apricot Pie of the Tiger 6/4 pack 16oz','Patrick','CMC: James weekly recap'),
('2016250','2026-10-01'::date,'James','On Premise Visit','Visited','Customer has not had a chance to sample the product i left on my previous visit and states they will reach out with feedback once they have tried everything',null,'John','CMC: James weekly recap'),
('4608687','2026-10-01'::date,'James','On Premise Visit','Visited','Spoke with both buyers at the account. Brandt tried the products and liked the big daddy ipa. Customer rotates things weekly and states that it is okay to email him weekly because he gets inundated with product all the time and this helps to keep us top of mind when he is ordering. I will begin sending weekly emails in hopes it leads to a purchase. I also offered to hand tag a keg or two if it doesnt meet the minimum',null,'Brandt','CMC: James weekly recap'),
('4092510','2026-10-01'::date,'James','Field Visit','Visited','Main point of contact was not in, on my previous visit Customer had been looking for the brand and could not find where to get it. He is happy to know it is with markstein and will sample product and review sales materials. Worry is that he wont order enough to hit the minimum so i offered to hand tag if he can''t. Employee had not heard anything but stated he would pass along my card. I will reach out via email to see what the feedback is on our products',null,'Luis','CMC: James weekly recap'),
('96325','2026-10-01'::date,'James','Off Premise Visit','Committed','Customer will most likely add the 19.2s to be placed in the grab and go cooler at the front of the store. Customer will also sample and review the other approved SKUs and decide what makes sense for them','Committed: Big Daddy IPA 12 pack 19.2oz Cans','Vashawn','CMC: James weekly recap'),
('4007617','2026-10-01'::date,'James','Off Premise Visit','Visited','Customer is focused on things in the current schematic and selling through the remaining octoberfest products',null,'Romina','CMC: James weekly recap'),
('533001','2026-10-01'::date,'James','Off Premise Visit','Visited','The big daddy has slowed at the account. Right now the account is focused on pull through for the 2 SKUs. Left samples to hand out to his regular customers',null,'Nick','CMC: James weekly recap'),
('2915444','2026-10-02'::date,'James','Off Premise Visit','Visited','Product is full and on the shelf. I did a quick reset to get the captain hazy and big daddy next to each other on the dry shelf because the captain hazy was in a less desirable location. I believe this will help increase visibility and pull through',null,'Kevin','CMC: James weekly recap'),
('3660546','2026-10-02'::date,'James','On Premise Visit','Visited','Customer has not had a chance to sample the product yet but states they will reach out with feedback once they have. I will continue to monitor this account for opportunities and build rapport',null,'Melissa','CMC: James weekly recap'),
('2959625','2026-10-02'::date,'James','On Premise Visit','Visited','On my previous visit i did not have samples so today i just reintroduced the brand and our offerings through markstein. Customer will sample the product and see what she believes makes the most sense for her account and take it from there',null,'Amber','CMC: James weekly recap'),
('2352857','2026-10-02'::date,'James','On Premise Visit','Visited','On my previous visit i did not have any samples. Today i dropped off some freshies and also noticed that the account has the sam Adam''s cherry wheat ale on tap which immediately made me think of peachy vibes. I mentioned it to him and he requested samples to consider it to replace that tap once available',null,'Art','CMC: James weekly recap'),
