('3969832','2026-09-08'::date,'James','On Premise Visit','Visited','Customer states that corporate will not allow him to add another beer at this time, but he is looking for something to transition into once fall hits. Customer will sample and review sales materials to see what he believes is a good fit for his account',null,'Amar','CMC: James weekly recap'),
