('2915444','2026-09-11'::date,'James','Off Premise Visit','Visited','The big daddy has sold one unit so far since replenishment and the captain hazy has no movement so far. The accounts primary focus is on their inventory on Monday but on my next visit i will try to expand at the account to offer the big daddy singles and i will try to gain better dry shelf placement and possibly addition to the cooler',null,'Kevin','CMC: James weekly recap'),
