('3941811','2026-09-21'::date,'James','On Premise Visit','Visited','The owner has not responded to my text or emails however the bartender I spoke with stated that the focus has been on replacing and repairing their two separate six tap kegerators that are currently not working right now. They only have one of the three kegerators in working order so they are down to just six taps and he believes that it would be better to revisit again in a couple of weeks when this matter is hopefully resolved but also states that he is almost certain that at the least big daddy will get back in to this account because they have had it in the past and it sold well',null,'Mitch','CMC: James weekly recap'),
('3979526','2026-09-22'::date,'James','Off Premise Visit','Visited','Customer is only focused on items in the current schematic at this time',null,'Scott','CMC: James weekly recap'),
('4030029','2026-09-22'::date,'James','Off Premise Visit','Visited','The big daddy singles and the six packs are about half way full, account wants to let them sell through more before considering reinvestment',null,'Ryan','CMC: James weekly recap'),
('1948716','2026-09-22'::date,'James','Off Premise Visit','Visited','Customer is focused on items in the current schematic',null,'Bob','CMC: James weekly recap'),
('2016478','2026-09-22'::date,'James','Off Premise Visit','Committed','Customer is out of stock on the big daddy ipa and approved reinvestment in the sku. As for captain hazy, the account has one 4 pack remaining on the shelf and the customer does not believe that the pull through was quick enough to warrant reinvestment and his sales data on the pie of the tiger leads him to believe that it is too slow a mover for him to invest in as well.','Committed: Big Daddy IPA 4/6 pack 12oz Cans','Hera','CMC: James weekly recap'),
