('2214021','2026-09-22'::date,'James','On Premise Visit','Visited','Bar manager is off today, on my last visit he stated that he can absolutely see any of the beers doing well at his account. He likes to keep a rotating tap list to keep a variety of options. He is drawn to the big daddy immediately and will sample the product and review sales materials to determine if we make sense for his account. This is a bi weekly account that submits their own orders online',null,'Sam','CMC: James weekly recap'),
('2355677','2026-09-22'::date,'James','On Premise Visit','Visited','Customer believes that even though the liquid was enjoyable and that he likes the big daddy ipa that they are pretty set on their current offerings and align with the sentiment that if it isnt broke, dont fix it. The buyer stating that it is hard to get new product into this account but he will bring it up to account ownership later this week',null,'Kyle','CMC: James weekly recap'),
('3432870','2026-09-22'::date,'James','On Premise Visit','Visited','On my last visit the customer could see any of these craft options fitting in with his rotating taps but he was immediately drawn to the big daddy ipa. Customer will sample the product and review sales materials to see if it makes sense for the account and take it from there. Today the assistant manager stated that the buyer has not relayed any plans to move forward with our brand',null,'Jim','CMC: James weekly recap'),
('4589692','2026-09-22'::date,'James','On Premise Visit','Visited','The account buyer is away on vacation and will not return for a couple of weeks. The buyer did not communicate any plans on moving forward with our brand at this time however the bartender is texting them my contact information so that they can contact me with any feedback that they may have',null,'Ernesto','CMC: James weekly recap'),
('4127823','2026-09-22'::date,'James','On Premise Visit','Visited','The account owner and my normal point of contact are both not in right now however i reached out via text to check in and am awaiting a response. No changes in product options have occurred and there are multiple open taps',null,'Jasive','CMC: James weekly recap'),
('3605388','2026-09-22'::date,'James','On Premise Visit','Visited','Account has a lot of IPAs but no hazys or sours. The customer was most interested in the pie of the tiger but ownership has final say. Customer will review sales materials and sample these products with ownership to determine if any of our products make sense for the account',null,'Steven','CMC: James weekly recap'),
('2747837','2026-09-22'::date,'James','Field Visit','Visited','Customer is going to hold off on the brand for now as he believes that this is not in touch with what he is selling the most right now at his account',null,'Anthony','CMC: James weekly recap'),
('530864','2026-09-23'::date,'James','Off Premise Visit','Visited','Product is full and on the shelf with POS. The customer who was purchasing the product has not returned and at this time there is no need to order',null,'Manny','CMC: James weekly recap'),
('4833433','2026-09-23'::date,'James','Off Premise Visit','Visited','Customer states that right now she doesnt have the space to accommodate any new items but she will keep the brand in mind for her next scheduled delivery day',null,'Ayda','CMC: James weekly recap'),
