('536745','2026-09-23'::date,'James','Off Premise Visit','Visited','Customer received all of their prior commitments. I added POS. Sold a few units here and there but the shelf is mostly full right now and there is no need to reorder this time around.',null,'Wahid','CMC: James weekly recap'),
