('2014697','2026-09-24'::date,'James','On Premise Visit','Visited','Customer did not receive the keg of peachy vibes and now is overloaded with octoberfest beers. She wants to hold off on the beer so she can focus on selling through the seasonal products for now. Customer asked about pie of the tiger and left another sample, hopefully that translates to a keg placement. Big daddy is up and running good',null,null,'CMC: James weekly recap'),
('3129050','2026-09-24'::date,'James','On Premise Visit','Committed','Customer brought in big daddy for their speakeasy/prohibition themed anniversary party. Big thanks to Mike at Markstein for gaining approval. Grabbed product from matagrano and delivered it to the account. Dropped off POS. Mike also made sure to get them a tap handle. Great teamwork all around.','Committed: Big Daddy IPA 1/6 Barrel Keg x2','Jamaica','CMC: James weekly recap'),
