('4164526','2026-09-24'::date,'James','On Premise Visit','Visited','I have not heard back from the owner about any of the samples I left on my previous visit and the bartender states that he grabbed the samples but hasnt communicated whether or not he is moving forward with anything. I reached out via text and he has not responded. I will try to contact him again but it can be hard to place where he will be since he is focused on the rebuild of his second location in pleasant hill that burned down',null,'Terry','CMC: James weekly recap'),
