('2921568','2026-09-25'::date,'James','Off Premise Visit','Visited','Customer enjoyed the samples I brought on previous visits and states that he will bringing in the 19.2s as soon as we are back in stock at markstein. He also stated he would do 12pks if we had them but that he was impressed that the product held up even though it is now produced by a different brewery',null,'Joseph','CMC: James weekly recap'),
('537312','2026-09-25'::date,'James','On Premise Visit','Visited','On my previous visit Toby the food and beverage director stated that he enjoyed the samples i left and wants me to return in 2 weeks to set which beers he would like to close out the year with. He verbally committed to the big daddy ipa replacing the Elysian space dust ipa because the sales on that tap have slowed dramatically in his opinion. Today he was unable to chat because he was performing interviews, i reached out via email to reschedule a better time to stop by and evaluate opportunities moving forward',null,'Seth','CMC: James weekly recap'),
