('2937170','2026-09-14'::date,'James','Field Visit','Visited','Introduced the brand and its portfolio options. The customer will review sales materials with account ownership to identify whether or not they believe the product makes sense for their account. This account is part of a restaurant group. It is not clear if they are an active distributor partner.',null,'Brad','CMC: James weekly recap'),
