('4062564','2026-09-15'::date,'James','On Premise Visit','Visited','Customer is going to sample the product and review sales materials to see if he believes any of the products make sense for the account. Customer states he hasnt had big daddy since the brewery shut down and he is familiar with both captain hazy and pie of the tiger.',null,'Jesse','CMC: James weekly recap'),
