('3768523','2026-09-15'::date,'James','Off Premise Visit','Committed','Customer currently has the big daddy singles on the shelf and will now expand to offer the big daddy six packs, captain hazy 4 packs and pie of the tiger 4 packs on their next scheduled delivery. Left POS to display once product lands','Committed: Full Circle Apricot Pie of the Tiger 6/4 pack 16oz; Full Circle Captain Save a Hop West Coast IPA 6/4 pack 16oz; Big Daddy IPA 4/6 pack 12oz Cans','Jair Vargas','CMC: James weekly recap'),
('4137151','2026-09-15'::date,'James','On Premise Visit','Visited','On my last visit, Customer will sample the IPAs and review sales materials before sharing thoughts with ownership if he is interested in moving forward. Today the customer states he believes that the big daddy ipa would do well here but now comes the hard part, getting approval from ownership. This is a marathon not a sprint account, it took months before I gained placement for my other brewery.',null,'Kevin','CMC: James weekly recap'),
