('2982881','2026-09-16'::date,'James','Off Premise Visit','Committed','The product is up and running at the account. The singles have been a hit and there is only one unit remaining on the shelf. The customer gave approval to reinvest in the sku and will review sales materials on our other offerings to see if he thinks anything makes sense for his account','Committed: Big Daddy IPA 12 pack 19.2oz Cans','Adrian Perez','CMC: James weekly recap'),
