('4049043','2026-09-16'::date,'James','Field Visit','Visited','Customer is familiar with big daddy and believes that this could be a good fit for the account but they have limited taps and a few ipas already. Customer will review sales materials and samples with the buyer tomorrow to see what they believe is a good fit for their account',null,'Ogie','CMC: James weekly recap'),
