('1949915','2026-09-17'::date,'James','On Premise Visit','Visited','The accounts bar is currently not running so there is only pre pack options available in the lobby mini mart. The account currently offers the basics and I mentioned that a great way to combat the ever changing demographics of a hotel is to focus on a product that provides value in the form of location and mission, like us. The customer believes that this could perform well here. Customer will sample product and review sales materials with the food and beverage director to see what they feel makes sense for their account and contact me or the craft specialist from our distributor partner when they are ready to convert to a sale and invest in the brand',null,'Tommy Hooks','CMC: James weekly recap'),
('3593957','2026-09-17'::date,'James','Off Premise Visit','Committed','Customer has been focused on getting through the accounts inventory that will be completed this Monday the 21st. Customer has agreed to invest in 2 cases of each as an initial investment to launch the brand at the account','Committed: Big Daddy IPA 4/6 pack 12oz Cans x2; Full Circle Captain Save a Hop Hazy IPA 6/4 pack 16oz x2','Lino','CMC: James weekly recap'),
