('3244172','2026-09-18'::date,'James','On Premise Visit','Visited','Brett wont be in until 5pm today, the bartender tells me that wednesdays at the same time are a safe bet so i will aim to meet him then. I left fresh samples for the 3 available SKUs with my contact information and will follow up next week',null,'Gadina','CMC: James weekly recap'),
